{% comment %}
  The "Product first" layout of the sock bundle block: the mix & match builder
  that sits below the buy box. Its button opens the picker in place of the
  photos, and the buy-more-save-more ladder becomes the pack as pairs go in.
  This sock's own size, quantity and add to cart are the theme's buy box.
  Rendered inside <sock-bundle>, which paints the ladder boxes and drives
  everything here.

  Accepts:
  - block: the `sock_bundle` block from sections/main-product.liquid

  Usage:
  {% render 'sock-bundle-teaser', block: block %}
{% endcomment %}

<div class="sock-bundle__teaser" data-sock-teaser>
  <div class="sock-bundle__teaser-top">
    {%- comment -%} Leads with where the pack stands: "Add 2 pairs to save 10%". {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="sock-bundle__teaser-msg" data-sock-bundle-shipnote aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
    <span
      class="sock-bundle__teaser-note"
      data-sock-teaser-note
      data-default-text="{{ block.settings.teaser_note | escape }}"
    >
      {{- block.settings.teaser_note | escape -}}
    </span>
    {%- comment -%} Folds the docked pack on a phone down to its bar, subtotal and checkout. {%- endcomment -%}
    <button
      type="button"
      class="sock-bundle__teaser-toggle"
      data-sock-teaser-toggle
      aria-expanded="true"
      aria-label="{{ block.settings.teaser_heading | default: 'Your pack' | escape }}"
    >
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      </svg>
    </button>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%}
    The builder's progress bar, filling toward the top of the ladder; sock-bundle.js
    hides the goal at its end when the top pack has no free shipping.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if block.settings.show_progress_bar -%}
    <div class="sock-bundle__progress sock-bundle__teaser-progress" data-sock-bundle-progressbar>
      <div class="sock-bundle__progress-track">
        <div class="sock-bundle__progress-fill" data-sock-bundle-progressfill style="width: 0%"></div>
        {%- if block.settings.free_shipping_enable -%}
          <span class="sock-bundle__progress-marker" data-sock-bundle-shipmarker hidden>
            <span class="sock-bundle__progress-marker-dot"></span>
          </span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
      <span class="sock-bundle__teaser-goal" data-sock-teaser-goal>
        {{- block.settings.tier_free_shipping_label | default: 'Free shipping' | escape -}}
      </span>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} sock-bundle.js lays the ladder out here, one box per pair. {%- endcomment -%}
  <ul class="sock-bundle__teaser-slots" role="list" data-sock-teaser-slots></ul>

  {%- comment -%} Starts a pack; gone once one is under way. {%- endcomment -%}
  <button
    type="button"
    class="btn sock-bundle__teaser-open"
    data-sock-teaser-open
  >
    {{ block.settings.teaser_open_text | default: 'Mix & match designs' | escape }}
  </button>

  <div class="sock-bundle__teaser-foot" data-sock-bundle-summary hidden>
    <div class="sock-bundle__teaser-subtotal">
      <span>
        {{- 'cart.general.subtotal' | t }} (<span data-sock-teaser-count></span>)
      </span>
      <span>
        <span class="sock-bundle__teaser-save" data-sock-bundle-save hidden></span>
        <s class="sock-bundle__teaser-compare" data-sock-bundle-compare hidden></s>
        <strong class="sock-bundle__teaser-total" data-sock-bundle-total></strong>
      </span>
    </div>
    <button
      type="button"
      class="btn btn--full sock-bundle__atc"
      data-sock-bundle-atc
      disabled
    >
      {{ block.settings.checkout_text | default: 'Checkout' | escape }}
    </button>
  </div>

  <div class="sock-bundle__error" data-sock-bundle-error role="alert"></div>
</div>
